# fixtures/hex/fragments/values/op-values.hex: [F08 §5.6], one value of every type in the stored form of an op value
# ([F06 §5.1]): the type byte, then the value bytes of [F08 §5.2]. Decode as a sequence of typed values to the end of
# the file. Store-local numbers as [F08 §5.6] assumes them: root `project` = root symbol 1; the text `ok` = text
# symbol 7; the field's enumeration numbers `high` as 2; #40 with uid U; commit id C; SHA-1 digest D. U, C, C2, D256:
# BLAKE3 of fixed labels, D a fixed SHA-1 digest (all in fixtures/hex/INDEX.md §2). After the table's
# fifteen values come five sets of the element types the stores do not use (enum, text, ref, commitref, oid),
# elements strictly ascending by [F08 §5.5].

# absent
00                                          # type byte 0x00

# bool false
01                                          # type byte 0x01

# bool true
81                                          # type byte 0x81 (vbit set)

# int -3
02                                          # type byte 0x02
05                                          # value bytes

# counter 300
03                                          # type byte 0x03
d8 04                                       # value bytes

# f64 1.5
04                                          # type byte 0x04
00 00 00 00 00 00 f8 3f                     # value bytes

# enum `high` (value 2)
05                                          # type byte 0x05
02                                          # value bytes

# text `ok`
06                                          # type byte 0x06
02 6f 6b                                    # value bytes

# sym `ok` (text symbol 7)
07                                          # type byte 0x07
07                                          # value bytes

# set {1, 5} of int
08                                          # type byte 0x08
02 02 02 0a                                 # value bytes

# ref #40 (uid U)
09                                          # type byte 0x09
28 00 00 00                                 # value bytes

# commitref C
0a                                          # type byte 0x0a
9b 0b e9 5d f3 7b 6f 6c e6 d2 08 ab 5b db 59 64  # value bytes
c7 23 37 96 eb f6 00 91 40 b3 46 87 4d 7f d9 8b

# path project:docs/a.md (root symbol 1)
0b                                          # type byte 0x0b
01 00 09 64 6f 63 73 2f 61 2e 6d 64         # value bytes

# oid sha1 D
0c                                          # type byte 0x0c
01 d9 4d b1 af fb 1b dd d9 49 1c d7 66 62 32 df  # value bytes
ce 91 5c 31 10

# pathmove explicit project:a/ -> project:b/, no git
0d                                          # type byte 0x0d
03 00 00 6c 50 c4 a0 01 01 01 00 02 61 2f 01 00  # value bytes
02 62 2f 00

# set {2, 3} of enum
08                                          # type byte 0x08 set
05                                          # elem: the element type byte
02                                          # n = 2
02 03                                       # elements

# set {`a`, `b`} of text
08                                          # type byte 0x08 set
06                                          # elem: the element type byte
02                                          # n = 2
01 61 01 62                                 # elements

# set {#40, #41} of ref
08                                          # type byte 0x08 set
09                                          # elem: the element type byte
02                                          # n = 2
28 00 00 00 29 00 00 00                     # elements

# set of two commitrefs, bytewise
